https://github.com/dexidp/dex

The Platform distribution updates golang.org/x/net from v0.59.0 to v0.60.0.
The source patch and build procedure are in devantler-tech/platform.
It retains Dex's compiled connectors and storage backends, including SQLite.
The image launches Dex directly: gomplate templates and the upstream container
entrypoint are not included. Supply an already-rendered native Dex configuration.
Dex's own environment expansion remains available.

Dex and its bundled web files retain the upstream Apache-2.0 license. Third-party
dependency license and notice files copied by Go's vendor operation are included
alongside the upstream license. source.tar.gz supplies the complete patched Dex
and vendored dependency sources, including MPL-covered files. To rebuild Dex,
use Go 1.27.4, CGO_ENABLED=1, CC=musl-gcc and the netgo,osusergo build tags with
the static external-link options in the published Platform build procedure.
Go and musl notices are included; the runtime base retains its own notices.
This modified image is maintained by Devantler Tech, not by the Dex project.
